(F5 T2 V4c: priority of the local beam z records. Group 0 has
 group_beam_direction_z 0 0 1 AND a reference point towards +y: the
 direction wins (element 1, local z = global z). Group 1 has only the
 reference point towards +y (element 2, local z = global y), and element
 3 of group 1 has element_beam_direction_z 0 0 1, which wins over the
 group reference point. Tip force 0.01 in y, tip velx velz rotx roty
 fixed. Expected, = Professional 02-08-2026: element_beam_force_moment
 1 = 3 = 0 -0.01 0 0 0 -0.01 0 0.01 0 0 0 0,
 2 = 0 0 -0.01 0 0.01 0 0 0 0.01 0 0 0; node_dof 2 and 6 vely
 8.333333333e-4, node_dof 4 vely 3.333333333e-3.
 group_beam_memory -total_linear (the Professional default beam memory;
 the GNU default -updated rotates the beam chord: BEAM-MEMORY-DEFAULT).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0
node 3 0 2 0
node 4 1 2 0
node 5 0 4 0
node 6 1 4 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
element 2 -beam 3 4
element 3 -beam 5 6
element_group 1 0
element_group 2 1
element_group 3 1
element_beam_direction_z 3 0 0 1
group_type 0 -beam
group_type 1 -beam
group_beam_young 0 1
group_beam_shear 0 1
group_beam_inertia 0 1 4 1
group_beam_memory 0 -total_linear
group_beam_young 1 1
group_beam_shear 1 1
group_beam_inertia 1 1 4 1
group_beam_memory 1 -total_linear
group_beam_direction_z 0 0 0 1
group_beam_direction_z_reference_point 0 0.5 3 0
group_beam_direction_z_reference_point 1 0.5 3 0
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 3 5 -ra -velx -vely -velz -rotx -roty -rotz
bounda_dof 2 -ra 2 4 6 -ra -velx -velz -rotx -roty
bounda_force 1 -ra 2 4 6 -ra -vely
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
